---
/**
 * KONTAKT. Copy verbatim, including the studio-inside-HAUTNAH note.
 *
 * The form posts nowhere yet: the booking backend is stage 5 and lives in
 * Supabase Edge Functions, outside this repo. Until then the form is marked
 * inert and the working routes (phone, WhatsApp, email) are given first, so no
 * visitor is ever led into a dead end. The honeypot and timing fields the spec
 * asks for are already in place for when the endpoint lands.
 */
import { socialImageUrl } from '../lib/images';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import LocationMap from '../components/LocationMap.astro';
import { BUSINESS } from '../lib/site';
import {
  graph, businessNode, personNode, websiteNode, webPageNode, breadcrumbNode,
} from '../lib/schema';

import studioExterior from '../assets/studio-exterior-hautnah.webp';

const title = 'KONTAKT | LUMA Wellness';
const description =
  'Nehmen Sie Kontakt mit LUMA Wellness by June Saurin in Buxtehude auf. Vereinbaren Sie heute Ihren Termin für professionelle Massagen und ganzheitliche Entspannung!';
const path = '/contact';

const schema = graph([
  businessNode([await socialImageUrl(studioExterior, Astro.site)]),
  personNode(),
  websiteNode(),
  webPageNode({ title, description, path, hasBreadcrumb: true }),
  breadcrumbNode(path, [
    { name: 'Startseite', path: '/' },
    { name: 'KONTAKT', path: '/contact' },
  ]),
]);

const waNumber = BUSINESS.phoneE164.replace('+', '');
---

<Layout {title} {description} {path} schema={schema}>
  {/* The old page was a wall of prose, a form, then a repeat of the same
      details underneath. The structure here is the order someone actually
      needs: how to reach June right now, then the studio and how to get to
      it, then the form for anything that is not urgent. */}

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="shell hero__inner">
      <div class="hero__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-fade>Kontakt</p>
        <h1 class="hero__title" data-reveal>Kontakt aufnehmen</h1>
        <p class="lede hero__lede" data-fade>
          Ich freue mich darauf, Sie persönlich bei LUMA Wellness by June Saurin in Buxtehude
          begrüßen zu dürfen. Vereinbaren Sie jetzt Ihren Massage-Termin und entdecken Sie
          ganzheitliche Anwendungen, die auf Ihr körperliches und seelisches Wohlbefinden
          ausgerichtet sind.
        </p>
      </div>

      <figure class="hero__figure float float--slow bleed" data-drift>
        <Photo
          src={studioExterior}
          alt="Das LUMA Wellness Studio in der Filiale HAUTNAH, Hauptstraße 19 in Buxtehude"
          widths={[480, 760, 1000]}
          sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 44vw"
          ratio="4 / 3"
          priority
        />
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Three ways to reach her, ranked by how fast they actually work. */}
  <section class="section--tight">
    <div class="shell">
      <ul class="ways">
        <li class="way rim spot" data-reveal2 style="--reveal-delay:0ms">
          <span class="spot__light" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <a href={`tel:${BUSINESS.phoneE164}`}>
            <span class="way__rank">Am schnellsten</span>
            <span class="way__label">Anrufen</span>
            <span class="way__value">{BUSINESS.phone}</span>
            <span class="way__note">Termine nur nach vorheriger Absprache</span>
          </a>
        </li>

        <li class="way rim spot" data-reveal2 style="--reveal-delay:80ms">
          <span class="spot__light" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <a href={`https://wa.me/${waNumber}`} rel="noopener">
            <span class="way__rank">Jederzeit</span>
            <span class="way__label">WhatsApp</span>
            <span class="way__value">{BUSINESS.whatsapp}</span>
            <span class="way__note">Antwort schnellstmöglich</span>
          </a>
        </li>

        <li class="way rim spot" data-reveal2 style="--reveal-delay:160ms">
          <span class="spot__light" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <a href={`mailto:${BUSINESS.email}`}>
            <span class="way__rank">Für Ausführliches</span>
            <span class="way__label">E-Mail</span>
            <span class="way__value">{BUSINESS.email}</span>
            <span class="way__note">Für ausführliche Anfragen</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>

      {/* Paragraphs two and three of the live page, verbatim. The migration
          rule is that copy is pasted and never paraphrased, and turning these
          into card captions was doing exactly that. */}
      <div class="prose ways__prose" data-fade>
        <p>
          Wenn ich gerade mit einer Anwendung beschäftigt bin, kann ich Ihren Anruf möglicherweise
          nicht sofort entgegennehmen. Senden Sie mir in diesem Fall einfach eine
          WhatsApp-Nachricht an
          <a href={`https://wa.me/${waNumber}`} class="underline-gold" rel="noopener">+49 178 8875085</a>,
          und ich melde mich schnellstmöglich zurück, um einen passenden Termin mit Ihnen zu finden.
        </p>
        <p>
          Alternativ erreichen Sie mich auch gerne per E-Mail an
          <a href={`mailto:${BUSINESS.email}`} class="underline-gold">june@luma-wellness.com</a>
          oder über das untenstehende Kontaktformular auf dieser Webseite. Ich beantworte Ihre
          Anfrage so rasch wie möglich, damit Sie bald die Vorzüge meiner international
          ausgezeichneten Massage-Expertise in Buxtehude genießen können.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* The studio: where it is, and one press to navigate there. */}
  <div class="shell">
    <LocationMap />
  </div>

  {/* The form comes last, because everything above it is faster. */}
  <section class="section" data-sunbeam>
    <div class="shell form__wrap">
      <div class="form__intro">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-fade>Relax. Erfrischen. Wiederbeleben.</p>
        <h2 data-reveal>Oder schreiben Sie mir hier</h2>
        <p class="form__lede" data-fade>Füllen Sie das untenstehende Formular aus.</p>
      </div>

      <form class="form rim" method="post" action="#" novalidate data-reveal2>
        <div class="form__row">
          <label class="field">
            <span class="field__label">Vorname</span>
            <input type="text" name="vorname" autocomplete="given-name" />
          </label>
          <label class="field">
            <span class="field__label">Nachname</span>
            <input type="text" name="nachname" autocomplete="family-name" />
          </label>
        </div>

        <label class="field">
          <span class="field__label">Email</span>
          <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" />
        </label>

        <label class="field">
          <span class="field__label">Thema</span>
          <input type="text" name="thema" />
        </label>

        <label class="field">
          <span class="field__label">Hier schreiben...</span>
          <textarea name="nachricht" rows="5"></textarea>
        </label>

        {/* Honeypot plus a timing field, so the form stays fast and accessible
            without a CAPTCHA. Both are read by create-booking in stage 5. */}
        <div class="hp" aria-hidden="true">
          <label>Firma<input type="text" name="firma" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label>
        </div>
        <input type="hidden" name="ts" value="" />

        <button type="submit" class="pill form__submit" disabled>Senden Sie</button>

        <p class="form__note">
          Das Formular wird derzeit noch angebunden. Bitte erreichen Sie mich in der Zwischenzeit
          telefonisch, per WhatsApp oder per E-Mail.
        </p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero { padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem) clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem); }

  .hero__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
  }

  .hero__title { font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 7vw, 4.6rem); line-height: 1.02; }
  .hero__lede { margin-top: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.9rem); max-width: 40ch; }
  .hero__figure { margin: 0; }

  /* --- Ways to reach her ------------------------------------------------- */
  /* Ranked, not listed. The rank line is the point: it tells someone which one
     to pick without making them weigh it up. */

  .ways {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 16rem), 1fr));
    gap: clamp(0.9rem, 2vw, 1.4rem);
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .way {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(130% 90% at 10% 100%, var(--wash-pink) 0%, transparent 62%),
      var(--surface-strong);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 26px rgb(43 38 34 / 0.06), inset 0 1px 0 rgb(255 255 255 / 0.75);
    transition: transform 0.6s var(--ease), box-shadow 0.6s var(--ease);
  }

  .way a {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    padding: clamp(1.35rem, 2.6vw, 1.8rem);
    min-height: 100%;
  }

  .way__rank {
    font-size: 0.5625rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.24em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--leaf-text);
  }

  .way__label {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.4vw, 1.8rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }

  .way__value {
    font-size: var(--step-small);
    color: var(--ink);
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  .way__note {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink-mute);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    .way:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 20px 46px rgb(43 38 34 / 0.1); }
    .way:hover .way__label { color: var(--leaf-text); }
  }

  /* --- Form -------------------------------------------------------------- */

  .ways__prose {
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem) auto 0;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .ways__prose :global(p) { margin-inline: auto; }

  .form__wrap {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .form__intro h2 { margin-bottom: 1.15rem; }
  .form__lede { color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 40ch; }

  .form {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.15rem;
    padding: clamp(1.6rem, 3.4vw, 2.6rem);
    border-radius: 22px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 80% at 90% 0%, var(--wash-sunset) 0%, transparent 58%),
      var(--surface-strong);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgb(43 38 34 / 0.08), inset 0 1px 0 rgb(255 255 255 / 0.8);
  }

  .form__row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.15rem; }

  .field { display: grid; gap: 0.5rem; }

  .field__label {
    font-size: var(--step-eyebrow);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-mute);
  }

  .field input,
  .field textarea {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 46px;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.05rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--step-small);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.78);
    border: 0;
    border-radius: var(--radius-interactive);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(63 118 82 / 0.16);
    transition: box-shadow 0.4s var(--ease);
  }

  .field textarea { resize: vertical; line-height: 1.6; }

  .field input:focus-visible,
  .field textarea:focus-visible {
    outline: none;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px var(--leaf);
  }

  .hp { position: absolute; left: -9999px; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; }

  .form__submit { margin-top: 0.4rem; justify-self: start; }
  .form__submit:disabled { opacity: 0.45; cursor: not-allowed; }

  .form__note {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink-mute);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero__inner, .form__wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero__figure { order: -1; margin-inline: calc(var(--gutter) * -1); width: calc(100% + var(--gutter) * 2); }
    .hero__figure :global(.media) { border-radius: 0 0 var(--radius-media) var(--radius-media); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .form__row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
